1.
Operational: BMT pageCnt is decreasing on AdvFS usr_domain domain. 
Check the domain immediately. 
This may indicate that the BMT is full or fragmented. Use the Utilities
command addvol to correct the problem and then invoke the rmvol command on
these devices.

You can avoid the problem by regularly running defragment. If you are not
running the AdvFS Utilities, you can defragment a domain by creating a new
domain with the mkfdmn command mkfdmn . Then use
vdump and vrestore to move the original filesets to the new domain. It is
highly recommended that you use the AdvFS Utilities. 

