David J. DeWolfe [sxdjd@java.sois.alaska.edu]
and
Sylvain Robitaille
who, along with one other, suggested an SCT newsgroup and checking with
vendor as well as RTFM.

Thanks all!!  The programmers appreciated your replies very much.

