I was somewhat mislead by the fact that I could not boot either from
disk or CDROM. Reason was the disk was bad and the CD drive doesn't 
work. What I finally did, I put the disk on another small Ultrix system.
#rzdisk -s 0 -1 	showed no bad blocks
#fsck			gave "Bad Super Block: Magic number wrong"
With 
