the config
files ie /sys/conf/OLDNAME to /sys/conf/NEWNAME.
Also I edited NENAME to change:
ident "OLDNAME"
to 
ident "NEWNAME"
Then copied OLDNAME.list to NEWNAME.list. Still is /sys/conf
then cd /sys
